---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-sm leading-relaxed">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6">Security Policy</h1>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Reporting a Vulnerability</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-400">
      We take security seriously. If you discover a vulnerability in Ironlox,
      please report it to
      <a href="mailto:security@ironlox.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">
        security@ironlox.com
      </a>.
    </p>
    <ul class="text-gray-400 mt-3 space-y-2 list-disc list-inside">
      <li>Do not file a public issue.</li>
      <li>Provide detailed steps to reproduce.</li>
      <li>We will acknowledge your report within 48 hours.</li>
      <li>We follow a 90-day disclosure policy.</li>
      <li>Credit is given on our Hall of Fame for valid reports.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mb-8">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Encryption</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-400">
      All vault data is encrypted with AES-256-GCM before leaving the client.
      We use Argon2id for key derivation. The server never sees plaintext data,
      master passwords, or encryption keys.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">PGP Key</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-400">
      You may encrypt sensitive reports to our PGP key (coming soon).
    </p>
  </section>
</main>
